# Personal bare-metal cron/maintenance tooling (hardcoded /home/manish/...
# paths, a personal conda env, `sudo systemctl restart`) -- never invoked
# by the container's own entrypoint or any application code (confirmed:
# zero references anywhere else in the repo). Excluded so it never ships
# inside the published production image; not deleted from the repo, since
# whether to keep it as tracked ops tooling is a separate decision outside
# this release's scope.
